Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `values[…]` already has a live view that conflicts with `second`
  --> tests/ui/view_list_overlap.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     second: &values[0..1]
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: Many read views may overlap, but an exclusive mutable view cannot overlap any other live view
 Fix: Finish using the earlier view before creating this one, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212

Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `values[…]` already has a live reference that conflicts with this access
  --> tests/ui/view_list_overlap.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |     return [first, second]
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: An exclusive write window cannot overlap another live reference to the same place
 Fix: Finish using the earlier reference before opening this one
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
